  "strings": {
    "entries": {
      "generatedtip_item_3118_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAP%@FlatMagicDamageMod@</attention>法术强度<br><attention>%i:scaleMana% @FlatMPPoolMod@</attention>法力<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>蔑视</passive><br>获得@UltimateHaste@终极技能急速。<br><br><passive>憎恨之雾</passive><br>在用你的终极技能对一个英雄造成伤害时，灼烧其脚下的地面@GroundDuration@秒，每秒造成<magicDamage>@GroundBurnDamagePerTickTooltipOnly@魔法伤害</magicDamage>并削减其<scaleMR>@MagicResistanceShred@魔法抗性</scaleMR>。<br></section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
      "generatedtip_item_6333_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAD%@FlatPhysicalDamageMod@</attention>攻击力<br><attention>%i:scaleArmor%@FlatArmorMod@</attention>护甲<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>无视痛苦</passive><br>所受的{{ Item_Melee_Ranged_Split_Dynamic }}伤害会以流血形式在@BleedDurationWorst@秒里持续扣除。<br><br><passive>蔑视</passive><br>如果一名在过去@TakedownWindow@秒内曾被你造成过伤害的英雄阵亡，会净化<passive>无视痛苦</passive>的剩余伤害，并在@HealDuration@秒里持续为你回复共<healing>@HealTotal@生命值</healing>。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
      "item_melee_ranged_split_dynamic": "{{ Item_Range_Mod_@ChampRange@_Dynamic }}",
      "generatedtip_item_3083_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleHealth%@FlatHPPoolMod@</attention>生命值<br><attention>%i:scaleHPRegen%@PercentBaseHPRegenMod*100@%</attention>基础生命回复</section><section><passive>狂徒之心</passive> <br>如果你拥有@HealthThreshold@额外生命值，并且在@OOCTimerChampion@秒内没有受到伤害，则每秒回复<healing>@TotalHealingTooltip@</healing>生命值。<br><br><passive>狂徒之活力</passive><br>获得额外生命值，相当于你@HPAmp*100@%的装备生命值(<healing>@f2@</healing>)。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
      "generatedtip_item_6673_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAD%@FlatPhysicalDamageMod@</attention>攻击力<br><attention>%i:scaleCrit%@FlatCritChanceMod*100@%</attention>暴击几率</section><section><passive>救主灵刃</passive> {{ Item_Cooldown }}<br>在受到将使你的生命值跌到@HealthThreshold*100@%以下的伤害时，提供持续@ShieldDuration@秒的<shield>@ShieldAmount@护盾值</shield>。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
      "item_cooldown": "%i:cooldown% (@Cooldown@秒)",
      "generatedtip_item_6692_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAD%@FlatPhysicalDamageMod@</attention>攻击力<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>永升之月</passive> {{ Item_Cooldown }}<br>在@WindowDuration@秒内用2次独立的攻击或技能命中一名英雄时，会造成<physicalDamage>@MaxHealthDamageCalc@最大生命值的物理伤害</physicalDamage>并为你提供持续@ShieldDuration@秒的<shield>@ShieldSplit@护盾值</shield>。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
      "generatedtip_item_1036_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAD%@FlatPhysicalDamageMod@</attention>攻击力</section><section></section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>"
    }
  }
}
